 "notes": [
  "TenantSwitcherComboBox posts `userSelectedTenant`, the tenant the session is for. Leave `data` empty: the runtime fills the list with the signed-in user's tenants, but only when the screen task's allInputKeys contains userSelectedTenant, so keep allInputKeys as given.",
  "Place it after the user is identified (after verify / OAuth exchange, before the End step); the actions that follow (SSO, consent, the JWT) read userSelectedTenant from the context.",
  "Matches the Tenant selector screens of the content templates shared-sso-domain-across-multiple-tenants, impersonate-within-tenant and agentic-hub-tenant-consent.",
  "Ids are console-shaped: screenId \"SC\" + 27 base62 chars, node ids 10-char nanoids equal to props.id. Using this screen twice in one flow: give the copy a new screenId (node ids only need to be unique within a screen)."
 ]
}
